A remap over an enum where one value is neither keyed nor accepted by the
target.
-- ship/history/0.0.thema --
schema: {
	kind: "a" | "b" | "c"
}
-- ship/1.0.thema --
schema: {
	kind: "a" | "b"
}

forward: {
	kind: remap(input.kind, {
		"a": "b"
	})
}
-- out/error --
remap of kind is not total: 0.0's kind may be "c", which no arm maps and 1.0's kind does not accept; add an arm for it, or a [_] arm:
    1.0.thema:6:8
